---
import Layout from '../../layouts/default.astro';

---
<Layout title="About | MECS" description="About ME Computer Services - Practical IT help with clear fixed prices.">
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>About MECS</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Practical IT help. Clear fixed prices.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>ME Computer Services (MECS) is an established IT consultancy that has transitioned to a focused service model offering practical IT help with transparent, fixed pricing.</p>
      <p>We understand that technology should serve your needs, not complicate them. Our approach is to solve IT problems efficiently and communicate clearly throughout the process.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="values">
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Transparency</h3>
          <p>We provide clear, fixed prices before any work begins. No hidden fees or surprise charges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Practical Solutions</h3>
          <p>We focus on solving your actual problems, not selling unnecessary services or equipment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Clear Communication</h3>
          <p>We explain technical concepts in plain language and keep you informed throughout our engagement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <h3>Reliability</h3>
          <p>We show up on time, complete work as agreed, and stand behind our services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-areas">
      <h2>Service Areas</h2>
      <p>Remote support is available by appointment. Local visits may be considered case by case when remote work is not suitable.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>